        text:
          '''Configure YouTube title parts in the form. Output updates live.

Default format:

`<TITLE> | द्रव्यदृष्टि प्रकाश # 001 | निहालचंद्रजी सोगानी | Fulchand | 2026-06-25`

Placeholders: `{topic}`, `{series}`, `{episodeMarker}`, `{episode}`, `{speaker}`, `{brand}`, `{date}`, `{separator}`
'''
        props:
          '''return {
  as: "div"
};'''
